    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d781">

                <pb facs="0893" n="797" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg797"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Loomis to Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-10-09"><hi rendition="#italic">October 9,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>May our war vessel, if requested, be used for conference between the President of
                    Venezuela and revolutionary leader? The latter will <pb facs="0894" n="798"
                        xml:id="pg798"/> in all probability be President of Venezuela before long.
                    The President of Venezuela is expected to resign if he can make satisfactory
                    arrangement. Confidential.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Loomis.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
